      summary:
        "Lift sibling state to the common parent; never mutate state (reference equality gates the render); pass handlers without calling them; and guard async responses against races (epoch/abort).",
      mistake:
        "Calling the function in the JSX prop (onClick={save()}), mutating state arrays/objects and expecting a render, and fixing races by adding a delay instead of a cancellation guard.",
      profile: "debugging",
